OL,3,GNEWSAMan forced to live in shed paid
OL,4,A#20 a day for work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who forced a homeless pensioner
OL,7,Fto live in a shed in his back garden,
OL,8,Fwhile exploiting him for labour and
OL,9,Fcalling him "Scrapyard Dog", has been
OL,10,Fjailed for six and a half years.
OL,12,FJames Dean Harrison housed the man, in
OL,13,Fhis 60s, in the shed between November
OL,14,F2022 and February 2026 after he
OL,15,Fapproached him for help when homeless.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
