OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAMan forced to live in shed paid
OL,4,A#20 a day for work
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarrison, from Coventry, took control
OL,7,Fof the victim's bank cards and refused
OL,8,Fto return them. He took #63,000, paid
OL,9,Fthrough Universal Credit and pension
OL,10,Fpayments, with police believing
OL,11,FHarrison used the money to fund
OL,12,Fholidays.
OL,14,FHarrison pleaded guilty to requiring a
OL,15,Fperson to perform forced labour and was
OL,16,Fsentenced at Warwick Crown Court on
OL,17,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
